  "testId": "testim-migrated/tests/webstore/plp/verify-obsolete-product-and-replacement-products-on-plp-and-quick-view.spec.ts > PLP - Verify Obsolete Product and Replacement Products on PLP and Quick View > verify obsolete product and replacement products on plp and quick view",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest searches an obsolete simple product, checks its PLP card name, SKU and obsolete message, follows the replacement link, checks the replacement product (name, SKU, price), adds it to cart and checks the cart line, clears the cart, then repeats from Quick View: obsolete message, replacement section, add the replacement to cart and check the line.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore as a guest (empty storageState).",
      "Search the obsolete SKU; assert results heading, card name, SKU and 'This product is obsolete. View replacement products.'.",
      "Click the card's replacement link; assert 'Replacement Product Suggestions' and the replacement card (name, SKU, price).",
      "Open the replacement card's quick add, Add to Cart, go to the cart; assert name, item cost and row total; Remove All.",
      "Search the obsolete SKU again; open Quick View; assert name, SKU and the Quick View obsolete message.",
      "Click the replacement link in Quick View; assert the replacement section; Add to Cart the replacement; assert cart name and item cost."
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "product_links",
      "price",
      "cart",
      "store"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "Adds the replacement product to the guest session cart twice (removes all items after the first time; the second line is not removed)."
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "PLP card and Quick View show the obsolete product's name, SKU and obsolete messages.",
      "Replacement section heading and the replacement product's name, SKU and price.",
      "Cart line name, item cost and row total equal the replacement price."
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title 'verify obsolete product and replacement products on plp and quick view' and the eight step labels match the flow; guest storageState; spec sets baseURL to the atstage webstore; no linked AIO cases.",
      "Data read by a raw JSON import (spec line 2: import testData from '...json'), not loadData.",
      "Profile: SKU z-1238988 FOUND as SimpleProduct 'testim.ObsoleteProduct' (PimProductId 991), active, PRODUCTION, no brand, inventory 5, storefrontProductIndex 1. tda rows: IsObsolete true; one ZnodePimLinkProductDetail link (attribute ProductSuggestions, PimAttributeId 1150) to PimProductId 451 = z-2200019 (Toro snow blower), FOUND active SimpleProduct, inventory 250, OutOfStockOptions DisablePurchasing, storefrontProductIndex 0 in the profile.",
      "Key PRODUCT_SIMPLE_OBSOLETE for the obsolete product (store); sku -> product.sku, productName -> product.name.",
      "PRODUCT_REPLACEMENT_OF_PRODUCT_IN_STOCK (pending) now covers the replacement: need replacement {product @product.productId, quantityUsed 1 (one unit added, again after Remove All), store}, preferred z-2200019 (source 12); replacementProductName -> replacement.name, replacementProductSKU -> replacement.sku, replacementProductPrice -> replacement.price (guest price: sales, else retail; shown as currency). The cart item cost and row total equal replacement.price (quantity 1).",
      "Data in code: PimProductIds 991 (hdgProductName991, divProductSKUContainer991, divObsoleteMessage991) recorded as data of alias product (product.productId) and 451 (hdgProductName451, divProductSKUContainer451, divProductCard451, linkProductName451, paraItemRowCost451, paraOrderRowTotal451) recorded as data of alias replacement (replacement.productId). A spec comment references the CSS id #0-z-2200019.",
      "migrate: raw JSON import (swap rule 1 fails), the replacement price is asserted (rule 3) and product ids are in code (rule 4)."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
